{
    desc => q{R enters replace mode},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
Action: `R` enters replace mode; typed characters overwrite existing text

Macro: `xt/visual/macros/replace_mode_R`

**initial.png** (before):
- Line 1: `hello world`
- Cursor at line 1, col 0 (normal mode)

Keys: `R`, type `BYE `, `Escape`

**after_replace_mode.png** (after):
- Line 1: `BYE o world` (`hell` overwritten with `BYE `)
- Mode label shows `-- NORMAL --`
- Cursor at line 1, col 4 (after last replaced char)
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('R');
        $ctx->delay(50);
        $ctx->type('BYE ');
        $ctx->key('Escape');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_replace_mode');
    },
}
__DATA__
hello world
